    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "SALE OF TWO STOREY EXTENDED THREE BEDROOM TERRACED END HOUSE IN CENTRAL LOCATION\r\n\r\nBuilt in the c.1970’s Fr Redmond Park is situated just off the Wexford Road, in a well-established area of town, short walk to schools, supermarkets, public transport, bus and rail, churches and all town amenities are all close to hand. The property comes to the market in exceptional condition throughout, and would be reminiscent of a quality showhouse with absolutely nothing to do but hang your hat, a dream home in great location, within minutes to town centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR\r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALL\r\n6.15m x 1.19m\r\nLovely tiling, storage under stairs and shelved, airing cupboard and immersion heater and cylinder. Stairs off.\r\n\r\nLIVING ROOM\r\n3.60m x 3.64m\r\nLocated to the front of the house, lovely big bright room with window looking onto the front garden, feature fireplace, back boiler, cast iron inset, tiled heart and timber surround, decorative wall shelf. Coving.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN / DINING ROOM\r\n6.78m / 4.42m\r\nNice fitted kitchen, with fitted units, Belfast sink, bar worktops, integrated cooker, gas hob, electric oven, electric heaters in kitchen. Patio door to garden, Velux windows.\r\n\r\nLovely bright kitchen, beautiful floor tiling, recessed lighting. Door to garden.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM\r\n2.32m x 1.80m\r\nComprising shower cubicle, new Triton T90 Instant electric shower. Fully tiled floor, wc and whb and vanity unit. Magnificent bathroom, no outlay.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nLANDING\r\nCarpet to floor.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1\r\n2.86m x 4.51m\r\nLocated to front of house, looking onto front garden, laminated floor, nice bright spacious room.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2\r\n3.4m x 2.76m\r\nLocated to back of house, bright room with laminate floor.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3\r\n2.64m x 2.58m\r\nLaminate floor, window to back.\r\n\r\nTotal Residential Floor Area: 91.06 m2 (980.16 ft2).\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\n\r\nNeat walled in front garden in lawn. Pedestrian access to rear enclosed garden, paved area, and decorative stone, water feature.\r\n\r\nGarden shed 3.67m x 2.7m\r\n\r\nConcrete floor, plumbed for washing machine, dryer and fridge freezer connected.\r\n\r\nThe back of the house is the “piece de resistance”, magnificent garden, very private with timber slated walls. Boundaries are clearly defined. Lovely area to sit and relax and enjoy those lazy summer days.\r\n\r\nServices: Mains electricity, water and sewage. Back boiler central heating.\r\n\r\nA Lovely compact town house in most convenient and central location.\r\n\r\nNEGOTIATOR\r\n\r\nPETER MILLS PROPERTY\r\n19 Lower Main Street, Arklow, Co. Wicklow V14 V6P0\r\n\r\n0402 32911\r\ninfo@petermillsproperty.com"
      },
